<h1>08_法律规范、行政指令与社会交互 (Law, Authority, Governance & Social Interaction)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本领域共 <b>100</b> 个核心动词 • 右侧直接展示 <b>💬 口语 Phrasal Verb 短语替换 ↔ ⚖️ 通用同义词 ↔ 🏛️ 正式学术升级词</b></p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('all')">全部动词</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('phrasal')">🔄 仅看含 Phrasal Verb 替换</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('Formal')">🏛️ 仅看正式/学术语域</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('Vivid')">🎨 仅看生动/叙事动词</button><span style='color:#fcd34d;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_立法、颁布、授权、强制与废除 (7)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_禁止、取缔、约束与审查拦截 (5)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_起诉、拘留、审讯、定罪与赦免 (13)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_合作、结盟、调解、遵守与违反 (75)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_立法、颁布、授权、强制与废除 (Enacting, Mandating, Authorizing & Repealing)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 7 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='19%'>核心动词 & 语域层级</th><th width='12%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='19%'>中文释义</th><th width='18%'>英文精准定义</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='27%'>🔄 Phrasal Verb 替换 & 语域阶梯</th></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>approve<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>agréer<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to approve</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ә'pru:v/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/agʁee/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('approve', 'agréer')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 赞同, 核准, 为...提供证据；vi. 赞许</td><td class='def-en'>give sanction to</td><td>4.08</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>plump for</span><span class='pv-pill'>plunk for</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>sanction</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>o.k.</span><span class='nt-pill'>okay</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“I approve of his educational policies”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>endorse<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>accoter<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to endorse</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/in'dɒ:s/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/akɔte/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('endorse', 'accoter')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 支持, 赞同, 背书于, 签署</td><td class='def-en'>be behind; approve of</td><td>3.63</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>plump for</span><span class='pv-pill'>plunk for</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>indorse</span><span class='fm-pill'>support</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>back</span><span class='nt-pill'>second</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“He plumped for the Labor Party”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>abolish<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>abolir<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 2e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to abolish</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ә'bɒliʃ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/abɔliʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('abolish', 'abolir')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 废止, 革除, 消灭</td><td class='def-en'>do away with</td><td>3.48</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>do away with</span><span class='pv-pill'>get rid of</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Slavery was abolished in the mid-19th century in America and in Russia”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>indemnify<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>indemnify<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to indemnify</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/in'demnifai/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/indemnify/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('indemnify', 'indemnify')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 赔偿, 补偿, 保护, 保障</td><td class='def-en'>secure against future loss, damage, or liability; give security for</td><td>2.61</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>make up for</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>compensate</span><span class='fm-pill'>recompense</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>repair</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“This plan indemnifies workers against wages lost through illness”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>validate<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>formaliser<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to validate</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'vælideit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/fɔʁmalize/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('validate', 'formaliser')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 使有效, 使生效, 确认, 证实, 验证</td><td class='def-en'>declare or make legally valid</td><td>3.4</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>formalize</span><span class='fm-pill'>formalise</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to validate (declare or make legally valid).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>authorize<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>approuver<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to authorize</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ɒ:θәraiz/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/apʁuve/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('authorize', 'approuver')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 授权, 批准, 委托</td><td class='def-en'>grant authorization or clearance for</td><td>3.38</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>authorise</span><span class='fm-pill'>empower</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>pass</span><span class='nt-pill'>clear</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Clear the manuscript for publication”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>ratify<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>infirmer<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to ratify</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'rætifai/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ̃fiʁme/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('ratify', 'infirmer')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 批准, 认可</td><td class='def-en'>approve and express assent, responsibility, or obligation</td><td>2.94</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>sign</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“All parties ratified the peace treaty”</div></div></td></tr>
